atch","merged_at":"2025-01-20T22:31:58Z"},"body":"Fixes the tree cursor always selecting the current item (as shown in the video) by reverting the change made in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86218/. The feature of #86218 (selecting nodes in the scene tree dock using arrow keys) was also implemented by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93543 and is still present in the editor.\r\n<details><summary>Video</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c848641a-0165-42cc-a1b0-93cc1279d377\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n</details> \r\n\r\n\r\n_If you think this feature (cursor element of the tree is selected with arrow keys) should be kept, I would create a separate pull request to fix the left and right arrow keys and add a checkbox to the inspector. If so, please what the default value should be._\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101160/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repo